## Known quirks / gotchas for the next agent

- PowerShell UTF8 BOM: [System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8 in WriteAllText writes a
  BOM; the lane writers use [System.Text.UTF8Encoding]::new($false) and the
  Python readers use utf-8-sig. Keep that convention.
- Select-Object -First N on a native-command pipeline KILLS the process
  mid-write (broke a build_graph once). Redirect to a log file instead.
- Git on this box intermittently leaves stale locks under .git when a script
  crashes (CHERRY_PICK_HEAD.lock, packed-refs.lock). Check Get-Process git,
  delete the locks, retry.
- The listener (serve_draco.ps1) runs detached; kill it by matching
  'serve_draco.ps1' in the command line when done with the harness.
- Local run artifacts of the harness (out/, logs/, staging/) are gitignored;
  decode_receipt.json + cdn/ + scripts are the committed evidence.

